'''Magikarp''' (Japanese: '''コイキング''' ''Koiking'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion.

