==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Magikarp|35}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Magikarp}}.
*'''Leap Out''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Deoxys|Magikarp|64}} from the {{TCG|EX Deoxys}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

